WEBVTT

00:02.040 --> 00:05.420
[narrator] <i>Ranma of the Saotome School</i>
<i>of Anything Goes Martial Arts.</i>

00:05.510 --> 00:06.630
[Ranma] Oh, yeah!

00:08.260 --> 00:10.180
-[narrator] <i>Win.</i>
-Oh, yeah!

00:10.890 --> 00:14.180
[narrator] <i>From Tendo Dojo, Akane Tendo.</i>

00:15.600 --> 00:16.810
[karate yell]

00:17.390 --> 00:19.190
-[narrator] <i>Win.</i>
-That was easy!

00:19.270 --> 00:22.310
[narrator] <i>These two teens were arranged</i>
<i>to be married by their parents.</i>

00:23.310 --> 00:24.690
You're not the boss of me.

00:24.770 --> 00:25.780
How annoying!

00:26.280 --> 00:28.700
[narrator] <i>But Ranma suffers</i>
<i>with a small problem.</i>

00:29.450 --> 00:32.990
<i>Whenever he's splashed with cold water,</i>
<i>he transforms into a girl.</i>

00:34.700 --> 00:38.960
NEW GAME - CONTINUE

00:43.290 --> 00:47.550
RANMA1/2

02:09.000 --> 02:10.420
THE HUNTER

02:10.510 --> 02:12.130
-[bell clanging]
-[villager shouts] There is a wild boar!

02:12.220 --> 02:14.760
Huge boar coming this way!

02:17.300 --> 02:18.930
-Here. [grunts]
-[screams]

02:20.470 --> 02:22.140
Help me! Help!

02:22.230 --> 02:23.430
[all gasp]

02:23.520 --> 02:25.230
-Huh?
-Hey, look out!

02:25.310 --> 02:28.020
-It's coming! Run away!
-[boar snorting]

02:30.280 --> 02:31.650
[boar squeals]

02:32.280 --> 02:34.240
[grunting]

02:34.320 --> 02:35.570
[exclaims]

02:35.660 --> 02:39.030
He stopped that boar in its tracks
with just a single hand.

02:39.620 --> 02:42.330
[grunting, panting]

02:43.330 --> 02:45.500
[snorting]

02:51.920 --> 02:53.050
[thuds]

02:53.130 --> 02:54.300
[whines]

02:54.380 --> 02:56.510
[all] Whoa.

02:56.590 --> 02:59.640
[villager 1] Wow.
This fella's something else.

02:59.720 --> 03:00.720
[villager 2] Incredible.

03:00.810 --> 03:02.560
-[villager 1] Are you a martial artist?
-[villager 3] Amazing.

03:02.640 --> 03:04.850
[villager 5] Have you been holing up
in the mountains to train?

03:05.560 --> 03:07.940
I'm trying to find Furinkan High School.

03:08.020 --> 03:09.730
Furinkan High School you say?

03:10.440 --> 03:12.730
Oh. Let me take a look at your map there.

03:12.820 --> 03:14.240
Huh. Hmm?

03:14.320 --> 03:17.660
Hmm. Wait, isn't this a map of Tokyo?

03:18.160 --> 03:20.910
This is Shikoku, friend. Yeah.

03:20.990 --> 03:23.580
Is that right? Then, I'll be off.

03:28.000 --> 03:29.330
[villager 5] He must be lost.

03:29.830 --> 03:33.710
<i>Ranma Saotome, I'm coming to find you.</i>

03:33.800 --> 03:34.880
NO ENTRY FOR LOST TRAVELERS

03:34.960 --> 03:36.630
<i>It's time to fight this out man-to-man.</i>

03:36.720 --> 03:39.220
<i>You should know better</i>
<i>than to try and hide from me!</i>

03:43.260 --> 03:44.680
ANYTHING GOES MARTIAL ARTS
TENDO DOJO

03:44.770 --> 03:46.390
[Kasumi] Ranma, please. You have to wait.

03:46.480 --> 03:48.480
[Ranma panting] No way, absolutely not.

03:49.230 --> 03:50.900
[Nabiki] Give it up already.

03:51.520 --> 03:53.070
[panting]

03:55.780 --> 03:58.200
There's no way you're gonna put me
in girls' clothes.

03:58.280 --> 04:02.200
But all of your clothing is still
in the laundry right now, Ranma.

04:02.280 --> 04:04.080
And the bath is almost ready.

04:04.160 --> 04:06.660
You can't wander all over the house
with your business out.

04:07.250 --> 04:09.790
-Come on!
-[Nabiki] You're a guest here. Got it?

04:10.920 --> 04:15.710
[Akane] Okay, but remind me why
it has to be my clothes that he puts on.

04:15.800 --> 04:19.050
I'm not gonna wear a skirt,
so don't even bother asking.

04:19.130 --> 04:20.890
You don't even know
what we're gonna give you.

04:20.970 --> 04:22.680
[Nabiki] Oh, okay, how about these?

04:27.730 --> 04:30.310
Mm-hmm. That looks cute on you.

04:30.400 --> 04:31.900
Wow, that's perfect.

04:32.520 --> 04:36.070
You sure about that? 'Cause it's kinda
feeling a little tight on the boobies.

04:36.150 --> 04:38.150
Really? What about the waist?

04:38.240 --> 04:39.280
Sorta baggy.

04:39.360 --> 04:40.660
[Akane growls]

04:41.240 --> 04:42.370
All right, Ranma!

04:42.450 --> 04:45.080
[Nabiki] You stop it.
Two young ladies should not be fighting.

04:45.160 --> 04:47.040
[Ranma] Well, too bad. I'm a guy!

04:47.120 --> 04:48.250
[cow lowing]

04:48.330 --> 04:50.370
[traveler] Do you know
where Furinkan High School is?

04:51.330 --> 04:53.420
You've come all the way out to Hokkaido.

04:55.250 --> 04:58.300
ONE WEEK LATER

04:58.380 --> 05:00.510
[students chattering]

05:03.390 --> 05:05.560
-[student 1] Look.
-[student 2] Huh?

05:05.640 --> 05:08.140
[student 1] Well, that's weird.
What's up with that guy?

05:09.850 --> 05:11.390
-[splutters]
-You there.

05:11.480 --> 05:13.060
[stammers] What do you want?

05:13.150 --> 05:14.400
[grunts]

05:14.480 --> 05:16.980
Do you know where Furinkan High School is?

05:17.070 --> 05:18.070
Huh?

05:18.150 --> 05:21.610
FURINKAN HIGH SCHOOL

05:21.700 --> 05:23.240
[grunts] Hmm?

05:27.290 --> 05:29.250
Where can I find Ranma Saotome?

05:29.950 --> 05:31.580
Oh. Over there.

05:32.080 --> 05:33.920
-[Ranma panting]
-[Akane] Ranma, wait for me.

05:34.500 --> 05:36.960
[Akane] Kasumi asked us
to go shopping, remember?

05:37.050 --> 05:39.090
And why do I have to go with you?

05:39.170 --> 05:41.470
'Cause you have to help me
carry back rice and miso.

05:41.550 --> 05:45.090
What's the matter? I thought you'd want
to prove how stupid strong you are.

05:45.180 --> 05:47.060
What did you say to me?

05:47.140 --> 05:49.390
Gonna have to catch me first!

05:49.470 --> 05:50.480
[groans]

05:51.180 --> 05:52.690
<i>Hmm? Bloodlust?</i>

05:53.690 --> 05:56.560
Ranma, get ready!

05:58.480 --> 06:00.740
-[Ranma] Huh? [grunts]
-[students] Whoa.

06:00.820 --> 06:01.900
[gasps]

06:04.570 --> 06:05.700
Hmm?

06:07.870 --> 06:09.700
-What gives?
-[scoffs]

06:10.450 --> 06:12.960
Running away just like you always do, huh?

06:13.040 --> 06:14.040
Ranma.

06:14.870 --> 06:16.210
Do you know him?

06:16.290 --> 06:17.290
Mmm?

06:18.380 --> 06:19.800
-Hmm.
-Hmm?

06:21.130 --> 06:22.380
-Mm-hmm.
-[sighs]

06:23.510 --> 06:25.300
[straining]

06:25.800 --> 06:29.470
Oh, yeah! You're, uh… the, uh…

06:29.560 --> 06:31.390
Uh. [groans]

06:31.470 --> 06:33.480
That brain's really working overtime, huh?

06:33.560 --> 06:34.940
You're…

06:35.020 --> 06:37.400
Allow me to ask one thing, Ranma.

06:37.940 --> 06:40.900
Why did you no-show
when it came time for us to fight?

06:40.980 --> 06:43.400
Oh! I remember now.

06:43.490 --> 06:46.320
I think you and I used to go
to the same school before.

06:46.910 --> 06:48.370
Ryoga Hibiki!

06:48.910 --> 06:50.080
How you doing, man?

06:50.160 --> 06:52.290
[grunts] You will answer the question!

06:52.830 --> 06:55.580
I waited around for you
at the spot we were supposed to meet

06:55.670 --> 06:57.170
for, like, three days, bro.

06:57.250 --> 06:58.380
Three days?

06:58.460 --> 06:59.750
Yes.

06:59.840 --> 07:03.130
But when I was finally able
to make it there on day four,

07:03.210 --> 07:05.510
I looked and you were nowhere to be found.

07:06.430 --> 07:09.890
All right then. I want to ask you
a question too, Ryoga.

07:09.970 --> 07:11.760
RYOGA'S HOUSE - EMPTY LOT
FOR FIGHT - RANMA'S HOUSE

07:11.850 --> 07:14.140
Could you tell me how it took you
four whole days to get there?

07:14.230 --> 07:15.350
You shut your mouth!

07:15.440 --> 07:18.230
Do you think I was spending
those four days of my life

07:18.310 --> 07:20.110
gaily skipping all over the place?

07:20.690 --> 07:23.070
Aw, son, this is Enoshima.

07:23.150 --> 07:24.900
You're in Harajuku, man.

07:25.740 --> 07:28.240
Are you an idiot? This is Asakusa.

07:28.320 --> 07:32.580
Do you have any real idea
of what I had to overcome to get here?

07:33.490 --> 07:35.120
A crappy sense of direction?

07:35.200 --> 07:36.710
That's what it looks like to me.

07:36.790 --> 07:39.750
Mm-hmm. Yeah, his direction is pretty bad.

07:39.830 --> 07:42.210
[Ryoga] You've broken
a gentleman's agreement.

07:42.300 --> 07:46.260
And then you ran away with your dad
to cower in China!

07:47.720 --> 07:49.930
[Ranma grunts] Let's get to the point.

07:50.010 --> 07:52.260
You want to try and find a way
to settle this.

07:52.350 --> 07:53.810
To settle this?

07:53.890 --> 07:55.220
Not even close.

07:55.310 --> 07:57.940
-I'm here to get revenge!
-[umbrella whirring]

07:58.940 --> 07:59.900
Oh.

08:02.980 --> 08:05.070
Hmm? [screaming]

08:08.490 --> 08:10.820
I don't even care what the cost is to me.

08:10.910 --> 08:13.410
I'll do anything it takes
to wipe out your joy.

08:13.490 --> 08:14.620
[gasps]

08:17.160 --> 08:18.620
CHALLENGE

08:18.710 --> 08:19.920
[Ranma] A letter of challenge?

08:20.000 --> 08:21.460
I've made it official.

08:22.210 --> 08:24.090
Don't run away from me this time.

08:27.880 --> 08:29.630
That guy really hates me.

08:31.090 --> 08:32.390
[sighs]

08:34.470 --> 08:37.020
Huh? Am I happy about anything?

08:37.520 --> 08:39.440
How am I supposed to know if you're happy?

08:40.730 --> 08:42.650
[crows cawing]

08:44.440 --> 08:47.190
-[twigs cracking]
-[footsteps approaching]

08:49.570 --> 08:52.620
[Ryoga] <i>Ranma, I'll find a way</i>
<i>to get my revenge.</i>

08:53.660 --> 08:58.540
<i>My life has gotten so far past the point</i>
<i>of messed up and it's all your fault.</i>

09:01.500 --> 09:04.090
<i>Just like this fragile walnut…</i> [grunts]

09:04.170 --> 09:05.170
[crow caws]

09:05.250 --> 09:08.420
…<i>I'll take your windpipe</i>
<i>into my hands.</i> [panting]

09:08.510 --> 09:10.090
<i>And crush it!</i>

09:10.170 --> 09:11.970
<i>Ready yourself, Ranma!</i>

09:12.800 --> 09:14.510
[Akane] So he's challenging you, huh?

09:15.470 --> 09:18.140
What did you do
to make him want to fight you so bad?

09:18.220 --> 09:19.850
That's a good question.

09:20.730 --> 09:21.940
Hmm.

09:22.020 --> 09:23.900
Oh, where are my keys?

09:23.980 --> 09:26.070
-Hang on to this for me.
-[groans] Hmm?

09:26.150 --> 09:27.070
[grunts]

09:27.150 --> 09:28.900
[straining]

09:28.990 --> 09:31.200
[exclaiming]

09:31.860 --> 09:33.240
[Akane] We're back.

09:33.320 --> 09:36.030
[Ranma straining] We got the stuff.

09:36.120 --> 09:37.160
A FEW DAYS LATER

09:37.240 --> 09:39.040
[Ranma, Akane] Thanks for making food!

09:39.120 --> 09:40.250
[sighs]

09:40.330 --> 09:41.500
Uh. [growls]

09:42.080 --> 09:43.420
You ass!

09:43.500 --> 09:45.080
-Fork over the sausage!
-[Akane sighs]

09:45.170 --> 09:47.250
Can't you let us eat our breakfast
in peace?

09:47.340 --> 09:49.550
-Animal! Just stick to bamboo!
-Oh, Ranma.

09:49.630 --> 09:53.130
-I think you left this on top of the miso.
-[grunting]

09:53.220 --> 09:54.930
Oh. Oh, I did?

09:55.930 --> 09:58.720
[Nabiki] Sorry, you were challenged
to a duel. Again?

09:59.310 --> 10:01.390
[chuckling] What did you do this time?

10:01.890 --> 10:03.940
That's the thing. I can't remember.

10:04.020 --> 10:05.480
It must be bad, right?

10:05.560 --> 10:08.320
It can't have been just anything.
He was really angry.

10:09.030 --> 10:10.900
-Oh!
-You figured it out?

10:10.990 --> 10:13.030
Here we go. It's all coming back to you.

10:13.950 --> 10:16.700
I think something happened
at the beginning of the semester.

10:16.780 --> 10:18.990
[bell chiming]

10:19.080 --> 10:21.000
[footsteps running]

10:22.960 --> 10:24.750
-Time for lunch, boys!
-[roaring]

10:24.830 --> 10:25.830
CAFETERIA

10:25.920 --> 10:28.380
[students clamoring] Hurry up!
What food have you got? Please!

10:28.460 --> 10:31.960
Okay! I got the last curry bun we have
right here.

10:32.050 --> 10:33.380
[all roar]

10:33.470 --> 10:34.970
Come here!

10:35.050 --> 10:37.180
[grunting]

10:38.970 --> 10:39.970
[chuckles]

10:40.060 --> 10:42.640
[supervisor] Next, we got
lots of red bean buns here!

10:42.730 --> 10:44.230
Who wants a red bean bun?

10:44.310 --> 10:46.940
You cad. What is it they call you?

10:47.520 --> 10:51.110
Hmm? Ranma Saotome.

10:51.190 --> 10:56.280
Ranma Saotome.
My curry bun grudge will never die!

10:57.740 --> 11:00.490
I'm pretty sure he was crying
from how frustrated he was.

11:00.990 --> 11:03.450
I mean, lunchtime was
always kind of a war zone.

11:03.540 --> 11:04.910
It was an all-boys' school.

11:05.000 --> 11:06.250
-Boys' school?
-Boys' school?

11:06.330 --> 11:08.670
Back then, I was a boy
a hundred percent of the time!

11:08.750 --> 11:10.170
Every single day of the year!

11:10.880 --> 11:13.880
[Akane] Okay. But all of this
over one curry bun?

11:14.470 --> 11:15.760
I know, right?

11:16.340 --> 11:18.510
If that's all… [groans]

11:20.100 --> 11:22.140
Hmm. Oh!

11:22.720 --> 11:26.350
[supervisor] All right, you animals.
Here comes the last yakisoba bun!

11:26.440 --> 11:27.850
-[both grunt]
-[crowd clamors]

11:27.940 --> 11:29.690
[Ranma] <i>I guess it was more than once.</i>

11:29.770 --> 11:31.820
[supervisor] Heads up!
Here's the last croquette bun!

11:32.690 --> 11:33.610
[Ranma] <i>Or maybe when--</i>

11:33.690 --> 11:34.990
[supervisor] Melon buns!

11:35.070 --> 11:36.360
Katsu sandwich!

11:36.450 --> 11:37.740
Meat bun!

11:37.820 --> 11:40.620
Oh, and I guess there was
also the seaweed bun.

11:40.700 --> 11:41.830
Hmm.

11:41.910 --> 11:44.580
[Kasumi] So it was
a lot of little things that piled up.

11:47.420 --> 11:48.920
Hmm?

11:49.000 --> 11:51.920
Hang on, Ranma.
The date of the challenge was yesterday.

11:52.000 --> 11:54.050
Huh? I wouldn't worry about it.

11:54.130 --> 11:56.380
That guy has no sense of direction at all.

11:56.470 --> 11:58.220
I betcha he's lost right now.

11:58.840 --> 12:00.470
It's this way to Tokyo, right?

12:00.550 --> 12:02.680
No, I just told you it's this way.

12:02.760 --> 12:04.810
What possessed you to go that way?

12:05.640 --> 12:08.770
<i>Just you wait, Ranma Saotome.</i>

12:11.980 --> 12:12.980
ONE WEEK LATER

12:13.070 --> 12:15.230
[interviewer] It's time for the season
with crystal-clear skies

12:15.320 --> 12:16.570
and light, pleasant breezes.

12:16.650 --> 12:19.070
Hello to all you
Furinkan High School students.

12:19.740 --> 12:21.740
We've all been gathered at school field 2,

12:21.820 --> 12:25.080
where Ranma Saotome of the Saotome School
of Anything Goes Martial Arts

12:25.160 --> 12:28.910
is about to face off against a mysterious
stranger claiming to be a student.

12:29.000 --> 12:30.210
We haven't even started,

12:30.290 --> 12:32.710
but the glares on their faces
have been fierce.

12:32.790 --> 12:35.670
It evokes images of historic fights
like Ganryujima.

12:35.750 --> 12:38.130
-What fate will befall our challengers?
-[heckler] Shut up!

12:38.220 --> 12:40.930
All we can do is hold our breath
and wait to see what will happen.

12:41.010 --> 12:43.260
You're currently listening
to live commentary

12:43.350 --> 12:46.970
brought to you by the Radio Club,
produced and narrated by me, Ichiro.

12:47.060 --> 12:48.430
-[sighs]
-[students chattering]

12:48.520 --> 12:52.560
Ranma. I see you didn't run away
like a coward this time.

12:52.650 --> 12:56.280
Easy there, Ryoga. I didn't come here
'cause I wanted to fight you.

12:57.610 --> 12:58.690
I got you these.

13:00.490 --> 13:01.490
CURRY BUN

13:01.570 --> 13:02.780
[Ryoga] What on earth…

13:02.870 --> 13:06.200
So we good?
It's all just water under the bridge now.

13:06.290 --> 13:08.160
[snorts] Enough with the jokes!

13:08.250 --> 13:10.620
Man, you're just getting greedy now.

13:10.710 --> 13:12.080
[rustling]

13:12.170 --> 13:13.210
Here you go.

13:15.040 --> 13:16.590
Yakisoba bun!

13:16.670 --> 13:17.760
[growls]

13:18.340 --> 13:22.050
[Ranma] Here's a croquette bun,
a melon bun and a katsu sandwich.

13:22.130 --> 13:24.510
A meat bun and… [singsongy]
…a seaweed bun.

13:24.600 --> 13:26.100
-How's that?
-[breathing shakily]

13:26.180 --> 13:28.180
I don't think I forgot anything, did I?

13:28.850 --> 13:30.940
-[grunting]
-[packets rustle]

13:31.520 --> 13:34.650
What kind of game are you playing
with me, you bastard?

13:35.480 --> 13:37.820
I thought this was
'cause you were mad about your buns.

13:37.900 --> 13:40.570
Who in the world would fight over buns?

13:41.400 --> 13:43.950
-Oh.
-Why bother spending money on these

13:44.030 --> 13:46.620
if they're all gonna be
past their expiration date?

13:46.700 --> 13:49.370
Well, yeah, 'cause I had to wait
for you to show up for a week.

13:49.450 --> 13:51.620
Enough. Let's go!

13:53.170 --> 13:54.420
Uh.

13:54.500 --> 13:55.880
Chill out a sec.

13:58.130 --> 14:00.210
Just tell me why first.

14:00.300 --> 14:03.720
I had to make my way through hell
and it's all your fault!

14:03.800 --> 14:04.800
[shouts]

14:07.600 --> 14:09.850
Yeah, I still don't get it.

14:09.930 --> 14:11.810
-Hmm.
-No, of course you don't.

14:11.890 --> 14:16.480
And even if I did try tell you the reason,
you wouldn't believe me to begin with.

14:16.560 --> 14:18.150
-Mmm?
-[whirring]

14:20.570 --> 14:22.490
-Hmm? Hmm?
-[elastic snaps, whips]

14:23.650 --> 14:24.660
Mmm.

14:24.740 --> 14:28.030
You won't be able to scurry away
from me now, Ranma!

14:28.870 --> 14:30.290
-Ryoga.
-[grunts]

14:30.370 --> 14:31.660
-How…
-[grunts]

14:32.830 --> 14:34.460
How many bandanas are you wearing?

14:35.040 --> 14:37.210
[Ryoga] That's the question
you wanna ask right now?

14:37.290 --> 14:38.880
He can't get away now!

14:38.960 --> 14:41.130
This match looks
like it's gonna be a close one.

14:41.210 --> 14:43.050
[students gasp, scream]

14:45.130 --> 14:46.180
[thuds]

14:48.300 --> 14:50.220
[grunts, strains]

14:50.310 --> 14:51.720
Why is this thing so heavy?

14:51.810 --> 14:54.980
[jabbers] I don't think I could lift it.

14:55.060 --> 14:56.650
-Let me try.
-[cracks]

14:56.730 --> 14:59.150
[weakly] I'm pretty sure
that thing made me throw my back out.

14:59.230 --> 15:02.440
[grunts] <i>How can he</i>
<i>just throw around something this heavy?</i>

15:03.400 --> 15:05.610
<i>He's on a</i>
<i>whole different level than Ranma.</i>

15:05.700 --> 15:07.570
How are you feeling right now?

15:07.660 --> 15:10.830
[gasps] Ranma, wait! You need
more space between you!

15:10.910 --> 15:13.700
It won't end well if he lands a hit!

15:13.790 --> 15:15.580
Huh? [grunts]

15:16.580 --> 15:17.580
Ha!

15:19.130 --> 15:20.630
Okay.

15:22.000 --> 15:24.670
Let's see what happens
when I make you bring your A-game.

15:24.760 --> 15:29.180
Ranma! This guy's no joke.
His arms are monsters!

15:29.260 --> 15:30.300
[grunts, chuckles]

15:30.390 --> 15:33.100
It took you this long to figure it out.

15:33.680 --> 15:34.730
[grunts]

15:36.770 --> 15:39.150
[grunting]

15:39.730 --> 15:40.940
[strains]

15:42.190 --> 15:44.990
So, Ryoga? How you wanna handle this?

15:46.610 --> 15:48.450
Do you think this is a joke?

15:49.070 --> 15:52.330
-I refuse to crawl…
-Mm-hmm.

15:52.410 --> 15:54.120
…on all fours

15:54.660 --> 15:57.960
-…like a dog!
-[students gasping]

15:59.580 --> 16:02.000
A one-armed spring into the air!

16:02.090 --> 16:03.460
Whoa, there!

16:05.010 --> 16:06.380
[grunts]

16:11.470 --> 16:13.470
[screams] He's coming this way!

16:13.560 --> 16:14.770
[grunts heavily]

16:14.850 --> 16:16.980
[Ryoga groans]

16:21.480 --> 16:23.730
-Take this!
-[yells]!

16:24.480 --> 16:25.940
-[tearing]
-Huh?

16:27.990 --> 16:30.360
You didn't have to destroy
my favorite shirt.

16:30.450 --> 16:34.700
I don't want to waste time talking about
girlie stuff in the middle of a fight!

16:35.240 --> 16:38.960
[grunts] Who says
liking clothes is girlie?

16:39.040 --> 16:40.920
-Ryoga!
-[grunts]

16:41.000 --> 16:43.880
-[Ichiro] He's jumped over the fence!
-[student 1] Follow him!

16:45.880 --> 16:47.300
I want you to take it back.

16:47.380 --> 16:50.130
Take it back now!

16:51.090 --> 16:52.050
[students] Whoa!

16:52.140 --> 16:55.850
What just happened? A pillar of water has
sprung up like a geyser.

16:55.930 --> 16:57.140
Ranma.

16:58.480 --> 17:00.440
-[umbrella whirring]
-[grunts]

17:01.900 --> 17:03.190
[kick splashes]

17:04.400 --> 17:06.320
-[Ranma grunts]
-[gasps]

17:09.780 --> 17:10.780
Let's go!

17:10.860 --> 17:13.240
Huh? Wha… Wait a mi--

17:13.950 --> 17:15.530
Where did you come from?

17:15.620 --> 17:17.580
Come on! Get your head back in the game!

17:18.200 --> 17:19.330
[whimpers]

17:19.410 --> 17:20.410
[Ranma yells]

17:22.210 --> 17:23.330
[grunts]

17:24.250 --> 17:25.790
Wha… Ranma?

17:25.880 --> 17:29.170
Who else could I possibly be,
you stupid idiot?

17:29.760 --> 17:31.380
Careful, Ranma. Your chest!

17:31.470 --> 17:32.470
Huh?

17:33.260 --> 17:34.470
[squeals]

17:34.550 --> 17:37.930
Did you really not notice
that you'd turned into a girl?

17:38.850 --> 17:41.140
R-Ranma. So then you're…

17:41.890 --> 17:42.900
[groans]

17:45.190 --> 17:48.190
[sighs] Go ahead and laugh
if you think it's so funny.

17:49.360 --> 17:52.450
I have no idea what I could've done
that made you hate me so much.

17:53.610 --> 17:55.200
But I'm trying.

17:55.280 --> 17:59.330
Whatever this body does, I just want
to live a happy and honest life.

17:59.410 --> 18:00.410
Hmm.

18:01.330 --> 18:02.960
[chuckling]

18:03.040 --> 18:04.500
Oh. Huh?

18:05.750 --> 18:06.750
Ha!

18:07.250 --> 18:10.300
Is this really
all that there is to your misery?

18:10.380 --> 18:13.220
Especially when you look
as cute as you do.

18:15.220 --> 18:18.180
You believe
your tale of woe will dissuade me?

18:18.260 --> 18:19.640
[bandana whizzing]

18:19.720 --> 18:21.980
-Don't make me laugh!
-[gasps]

18:22.560 --> 18:25.770
Uh-oh. We're seeing the beginnings
of a fierce battle ahead.

18:26.400 --> 18:28.440
-Wha… Something is flying this way!
-[whizzing]

18:28.520 --> 18:31.150
Is it a bird? Or a plane?
No, it's a bandana!

18:31.240 --> 18:32.320
[screams]

18:32.400 --> 18:34.280
I'll go get hot water. [grunts]

18:34.360 --> 18:36.280
You idiot. You'll get yourself hurt.

18:36.370 --> 18:37.200
I'll be okay.

18:37.780 --> 18:39.330
[grunts, exclaims]

18:39.410 --> 18:40.410
[bandanas whiz]

18:40.490 --> 18:41.790
[gasps]

18:41.870 --> 18:42.910
You're open!

18:44.250 --> 18:47.460
What will you do now?
Even if you dodge the umbrella,

18:47.540 --> 18:50.630
I'll use these bandanas
to attack you from every direction!

18:51.420 --> 18:52.420
[shouts]

18:54.800 --> 18:56.840
-[Ranma] Okay, hold on tight. Ready?
-[gasps]

18:56.930 --> 18:58.010
[Ranma grunts]

18:58.100 --> 19:00.010
-[Akane screaming]
-[thud]

19:00.640 --> 19:01.850
-[students gasp]
-The skill!

19:01.930 --> 19:03.600
Even while holding such heavy weapons,

19:03.680 --> 19:05.810
the combatants are leaping in the air
like dancers!

19:05.890 --> 19:07.900
[Ryoga] Running away, you coward?

19:07.980 --> 19:09.770
Uh, just give me a second.

19:13.820 --> 19:14.820
[grunts]

19:18.660 --> 19:19.910
[sighs]

19:20.410 --> 19:21.660
[umbrella thuds]

19:23.250 --> 19:24.330
[grunts]

19:24.410 --> 19:25.830
Uh…

19:26.620 --> 19:27.920
[whimpers]

19:28.000 --> 19:30.420
[grunts, groans]

19:31.920 --> 19:33.260
[whimpers]

19:37.590 --> 19:38.720
-Nice job!
-That was ju--

19:40.180 --> 19:41.810
Uh, what's going on?

19:42.430 --> 19:43.430
What do you mean?

19:43.930 --> 19:47.940
This is all your fault, you know.
Nobody asked you to get involved.

19:48.020 --> 19:50.860
Oh, yeah? Well there's no way
you would've beat him as a girl.

19:50.940 --> 19:53.320
-You know that.
-That's a pretty messed-up thing to say.

19:53.400 --> 19:56.280
This battle was supposed to be
a man-to-man before you poked in.

19:56.360 --> 19:57.740
[Akane] How exactly are you a man?

19:57.820 --> 20:00.240
-[arguing continues]
-Oh, look. What could he be doing now?

20:00.320 --> 20:02.120
-[Akane] …work this out for you.
-[Ranma] Huh?

20:02.200 --> 20:03.450
-[Ranma] Ah, just shut up!
-[grunts]

20:03.540 --> 20:04.660
-You always do this.
-[creaking]

20:04.750 --> 20:06.790
It's like you need to stick your nose
in other people's--

20:06.870 --> 20:08.460
If you were a little more cautious--

20:09.960 --> 20:11.080
[Akane gasps]

20:12.630 --> 20:14.380
[Ranma, Ryoga grunting]

20:14.960 --> 20:16.130
[growls]

20:16.220 --> 20:17.760
[Akane] Let me go.

20:17.840 --> 20:19.050
Are you serious?

20:19.130 --> 20:21.090
I'm not holding you
because I like it, idiot.

20:21.180 --> 20:22.180
[grunts]

20:22.260 --> 20:23.260
[slaps]

20:25.640 --> 20:26.810
Oh.

20:28.600 --> 20:29.600
[sobs]

20:30.150 --> 20:32.860
If my worrying about you is gonna be
that annoying,

20:32.940 --> 20:33.980
fine, then.

20:39.860 --> 20:40.990
Akane.

20:41.070 --> 20:42.870
We're not finished yet!

20:42.950 --> 20:45.160
-Shut up!
-[belt whirs]

20:47.790 --> 20:48.960
Akane.

20:50.540 --> 20:52.500
Uh… Um…

20:54.250 --> 20:55.460
I don't care.

20:56.460 --> 21:00.220
From now on, I don't want to have
anything to do with you anymore.

21:00.300 --> 21:01.180
[slices]

21:01.260 --> 21:02.720
[no audible dialogue]

21:07.140 --> 21:08.640
[breathes shakily]

21:10.100 --> 21:12.150
-[hair thumps]
-[Ryoga grunts]

21:12.230 --> 21:14.150
-[Akane] Uh…
-[shrieks]
